From f70ea3cae408f80f4e866ebae9d90c41f8e588fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:06:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Formula check runs LibreOffice only for changed formulas, one
 minute in all; the bench client uses the launch key

- _formula_result_miss reads formulas with openpyxl first; LibreOffice runs only for a workbook written this turn
  whose formulas differ from the input's, the originals only when the request says its formula is wrong, at most 3
  outputs, under one 60 s deadline (was up to 6 conversions of 90 s each). Replayed on 228 saved SpreadsheetBench
  runs: the same 7 failures flagged, no passing run; median 0.008 s, max 2.2 s per answer.
- testkit/bench3: since 1e954486 the page carries the API token only with the launch key the app prints, so every
  Meshpool app-arm run failed to start ("app server did not start", 0 calls). The client reads the key from the log.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Pf4xaMqQSJYs9jXfPpQcsK
